---
title: Andreas Holstenson
---
{% extends './layouts/base.njk' %}

{% block content %}
<main>
	<div class="home-callout">
		<div>
			<h1><span class="wave" aria-hidden="true">👋</span> Hi, I'm Andreas Holstenson</h1>

			<p>
				I work with user-centered problem solving using technology.
				You'll find me in Malmö, Sweden.
			</p>

			<p class="home-links">
				Want to get in touch? Send me an e-mail at
				<a href="mailto:a@holstenson.se">a@holstenson.se</a>,
				find me on Bluesky as <a href="https://bsky.app/profile/holstenson.se">@holstenson.se</a> or
				connect with me on <a href="http://se.linkedin.com/in/aholstenson">LinkedIn</a>.
			</p>

			<p class="home-links">
				You can find some of my code on <a href="https://github.com/aholstenson">GitHub</a>
				if that's your thing.{% if building | length %} In the last 90 days I've worked mostly on {% for repo in building %}{% if not loop.first %}{% if loop.last %} and {% else %}, {% endif %}{% endif %}<a href="{{ repo.url }}">{{ repo.name }}</a>{% endfor %}.{% endif %}
			</p>

			<p class="home-links">
				Outside of open source I'm currently exploring real-time collaboration and non-chat
				interfaces for AI, you can see some of that in <a href="https://protopaper.com/">Protopaper</a>.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>

	{% if collections.articles | length %}
		<div class="article-list">
			<h2>Latest updates</h2>

			{%- for article in collections.articles | limit(5) -%}
				<article>
					<h3>
						<span class="article-date">{{ article.date | isoDate }}</span>
						<a href="{{ article.url }}">{{ article.data.title }}</a>
					</h3>
					<p>{{ article.data.intro }}</p>
				</article>
			{%- endfor -%}
		</div>
	{% endif %}
</main>
{% endblock %}
